# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  ALLOWLIST .gitignore — this repo is PUBLIC.
#  Everything is ignored by default; only the paths explicitly un-ignored
#  below can ever be tracked. Dropping a new file in the repo does NOT stage
#  it unless it matches an allow rule — accidental inclusion takes real effort.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# 1) Ignore everything at the root.
/*

# 2) Permit only public content + generic (secret-free) tooling.
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/PUBLISHING.md
!/skills/
!/agents/
!/packs/
!/.claude-plugin/
!/scripts/
!/.githooks/

# 3) Belt-and-suspenders: never publish these even inside a permitted dir.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.local
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa*
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules/

# 4) The private denylist must NEVER live in this public repo. It belongs in
#    your home directory. These rules make it un-trackable even if copied in.
**/*denylist*
**/.codaptive-skills-denylist.txt
